msgid "Full-Stack Web Developer"
msgstr "Full-Stack veb-dasturchi"

msgid "Hello! I'm Ulug'bek Umaraliyev. I have 5+ years of hands-on experience building websites (news sites, blogs) and web applications (online stores, social platforms, messengers)."
msgstr "Salom! Men Ulug'bek Umaraliyev. Veb-saytlar (yangilik saytlari, bloglar) va veb-ilovalar (onlayn do'konlar, ijtimoiy platformalar, messenjerlar) yaratishda 5+ yillik amaliy tajribaga egaman."

msgid "I also build multifunctional Telegram bots — online stores, restaurant bots and more — designed to scale reliably."
msgstr "Shuningdek, ko'p funksiyali Telegram botlar yarataman — onlayn do'konlar, restoran botlari va boshqalar — ishonchli miqyoslash uchun mo'ljallangan."

